      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00305",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "千重子本来打算去参谒仇野的念佛寺，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Chieko had originally intended to visit Adashino's Nenbutsu-ji Temple,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00305",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "才登上那古老的石阶，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but she had only just climbed the old stone steps,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00305",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "一直来到左边山崖两尊石佛处附近，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and come as far as the two stone Buddhas on the cliff to the left,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00305",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "听见上面嘈杂的人声，便止住了脚步。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "when she heard noisy voices above and stopped in her tracks.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
